==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Noisy Neighbors]] in order to do [[Quest:Noise Permit]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Flynn]] located in [[Snowhill]].
==Goals==
Find Flynn's noise permit in Snowhill.
*Find the Permit
*Return to Flynn at the Snowhill Stage
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Flynn]] located on the right side of the [[Snowhill]] stage.
#*"Maybe one of the penguin mailmen dropped our permit or delivered it to the wrong address!<br /><font color="#CE7C28">Look around Snowhill</font> and find the <font color="#CE7C28">permit</font> before we have to close the show!" -Flynn
#Locate the permit
#*It can be found near the entrance to [[Snowhill]].
#Speak with [[Flynn]] located on the right side of the [[Snowhill]] stage.
#*"You found the permit?<br />Thank goodness. Those penguins sure do make loousy mailmen. The show will be able to continue now.<br />Thanks, and remember to rock on!" -Flynn
